<title>PORTUGAL: Caja de Madrid issues 5 bln esc 5-yr Navigator.</title>
<headline>Caja de Madrid issues 5 bln esc 5-yr Navigator.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Caja de Madrid is issuing a five-year Navigator bond for five billion escudos at a fixed rate of 6.77 percent under a Medium Term Note programme, said Banco Portugues de Investimento (BPI), leader of the operation.</p>
<p>&quot;The issue, structured jointly by BPI and Dresdner Bank, allows the issuer the possibility to make an early repayment of the loan on the payment date of the first coupon (December 16 1997),&quot; BPI said in a statement.</p>
<p>The subscription date is December 16 this year.</p>
</text>
